	Have you ever had the shit kicked out of you, and wanted to
find a place to lock yourself in, to wait several turns until you are
healed again?  Well, the problem is, many rooms have doors that don't
have doors (?)...

***spoilers follow***


...zapping a wand of locking at a door that has no door will produce a
locked door in that space.  So, enter a room, zap at all the doorways,
and voila! you are locked in, safe and sound.

	Another good way to save yourself some troubles is to enter a
shop, and pick something up.  Move towards the door, and the
shopkeeper will block you in.  If you have a ROConflict, he will kill
anything that comes to the door, too.  

	There you go, two ways to save your ass if you are beaten up.
Ideally, that shouldn't happen, tho'.  If you are getting below 1/2
your HPs you should run like hell.

